{
  "uid": "clearnet-prod-20260811",
  "title": "ClearNet — Production",
  "tags": ["clearnet", "production"],
  "description": "Supervision de la plateforme ClearNet V1.3 : disponibilité backend, trafic ingress, ressources, Redis/BullMQ, Neo4j. Importer dans Grafana → provisionner le datasource Prometheus (variable DS_PROMETHEUS).",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "Datasource"
      },
      {
        "name": "NAMESPACE",
        "type": "query",
        "query": { "query": "label_values(kube_namespace_name, namespace)" },
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "Namespace",
        "refresh": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Disponibilité",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 100
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Backend — réplicas disponibles",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\", deployment=~\".*backend.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "disponibles"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }, { "color": "green", "value": 3 } ] }, "unit": "short" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Backend — réplicas désirés",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(kube_deployment_spec_replicas{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\", deployment=~\".*backend.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "désirés"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pods backend prêts",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_ready{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\", pod=~\".*backend.*\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "prêts"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 } ] }, "unit": "short" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Neo4j — pods prêts (StatefulSet)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(kube_statefulset_status_replicas_ready{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\", statefulset=~\".*neo4j.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "prêts"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 } ] }, "unit": "short" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Trafic API (ingress-nginx)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 101
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requêtes par seconde (par ingress)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(nginx_ingress_controller_requests{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\"}[5m])) by (ingress)",
          "legendFormat": "{{ingress}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taux d'erreurs 5xx (%)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(nginx_ingress_controller_requests{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\", status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(nginx_ingress_controller_requests{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx %"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 5 } ] } }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latence p95 (s)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(nginx_ingress_controller_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.5 }, { "color": "red", "value": 2 } ] } } }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Ressources backend",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "id": 102
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU (cœurs, par pod)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\", pod=~\".*backend.*\", container!=\"\"}[5m])) by (pod)",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mémoire (working set, par pod)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"$NAMESPACE\", pod=~\".*backend.*\", container!=\"\"}) by (pod)",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } } }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Redis / File BullMQ",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "id": 103
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Redis — clients connectés",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "redis_connected_clients", "legendFormat": "clients" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Redis — mémoire utilisée",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "redis_memory_used_bytes", "legendFormat": "utilisée" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "File de règlements on-chain (BullMQ)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "File **onchain-settlement** (BullMQ, `QUEUE_ENABLED=true`).\n\n- Jobs en échec = règlements on-chain en dettes : `bull:*:onchain-settlement:failed`.\n- Depuis Redis CLI : `redis-cli -h <host> keys 'bull:*:onchain-settlement:*'` puis `LRANGE bull:clearnet:onchain-settlement:failed 0 -1`.\n- Exposition des métriques BullMQ (/metrics prom-client) : étape suivante d'industrialisation — voir README-PROD.md."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Redis — opérations par seconde",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "rate(redis_commands_processed_total[5m])", "legendFormat": "ops/s" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } } }
    }
  ]
}
